{"id":"d523f19a7e4590f1","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-wep.md","title":"Whole Embedding Property","display":"df-wep — Whole Embedding Property","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-wep","aliases":["93-df-wep"],"display":"df-wep — Whole Embedding Property","depends_on":["[[93-df-embedding]]","[[93-df-finite-algebra]]","[[93-df-ultraproduct]]","[[93-df-algebra]]","[[93-df-similarity-type]]","[[93-df-set-ultrafilter]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-wep"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-wep</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-wep — Whole Embedding Property"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d611f4ac8b8895ab\" href=\"?note=d611f4ac8b8895ab\" title=\"93-df-embedding\">93-df-embedding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"32c4e6b205cc3cd8\" href=\"?note=32c4e6b205cc3cd8\" title=\"93-df-finite-algebra\">93-df-finite-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"77d2ef3450d9750f\" href=\"?note=77d2ef3450d9750f\" title=\"93-df-ultraproduct\">93-df-ultraproduct</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" href=\"?note=ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" title=\"93-df-similarity-type\">93-df-similarity-type</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"7cc13e0d91069bbd\" href=\"?note=7cc13e0d91069bbd\" title=\"93-df-set-ultrafilter\">93-df-set-ultrafilter</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> is fixed and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K\">\\(\\mathcal K\\)</span> is a class candidate of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span>-algebras.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\\)</span> is the algebra predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}\\)</span> is the one-place type-validity predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" href=\"?note=ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" title=\"93-df-similarity-type\">93-df-similarity-type</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ultra}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ultra}\\)</span> is the exact predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"7cc13e0d91069bbd\" href=\"?note=7cc13e0d91069bbd\" title=\"93-df-set-ultrafilter\">93-df-set-ultrafilter</a>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinAlg}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{FinAlg}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UltProd}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{UltProd}_{93}\\)</span> have their local source signatures.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WEP}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{WEP}_{93}\\)</span> is defined here with its signature parameter exposed.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}wep}\\vdash\\mathrm{WEP}_{93}(\\mathcal K;\\tau)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)\\land\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\mathbf A\\in\\mathcal K\\;\\exists I\\;\\exists\\mathcal U\\;\\exists\\mathbf B\\;\\exists e\\;\\Bigl[\nI\\in V\\land I\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\mathbf B:I\\to V\\land\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;(\\mathbf B(i)\\in\\mathcal K\\land\\mathrm{FinAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf B(i)))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}\\bigl(e,\\mathbf A,\n\\mathrm{UltProd}_{93}(\\mathbf B,\\mathcal U;I,\\tau)\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}wep}\\vdash\\mathrm{WEP}_{93}(\\mathcal K;\\tau)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)\\land\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\mathbf A\\in\\mathcal K\\;\\exists I\\;\\exists\\mathcal U\\;\\exists\\mathbf B\\;\\exists e\\;\\Bigl[\nI\\in V\\land I\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\mathbf B:I\\to V\\land\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;(\\mathbf B(i)\\in\\mathcal K\\land\\mathrm{FinAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf B(i)))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}\\bigl(e,\\mathbf A,\n\\mathrm{UltProd}_{93}(\\mathbf B,\\mathcal U;I,\\tau)\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>“WEP” here is the Whole Embedding Property used by <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"a8c17e59e6ab2d52\" href=\"?note=a8c17e59e6ab2d52\" title=\"93-thm-josephus\">93-thm-josephus</a>: every whole member embeds into an ultraproduct of finite members of the same class.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"d611f4ac8b8895ab","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-embedding]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-finite-algebra","statu