:"[Remark]","excerpt":"“WEP” here is the Whole Embedding Property used by [[93-thm-josephus]]: every whole member embeds into an ultraproduct of finite members of the same class.","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal K","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ultra}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FinAlg}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UltProd}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WEP}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}wep}\\vdash\\mathrm{WEP}_{93}(\\mathcal K;\\tau)\\leftrightarrow{}&\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)\\land\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\mathbf A\\in\\mathcal K\\;\\exists I\\;\\exists\\mathcal U\\;\\exists\\mathbf B\\;\\exists e\\;\\Bigl[\nI\\in V\\land I\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\mathbf B:I\\to V\\land\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;(\\mathbf B(i)\\in\\mathcal K\\land\\mathrm{FinAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf B(i)))\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}\\bigl(e,\\mathbf A,\n\\mathrm{UltProd}_{93}(\\mathbf B,\\mathcal U;I,\\tau)\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1694,"backlinks":[{"id":"a8c17e59e6ab2d52","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FEP}_{93}$ and $\\mathrm{WEP}_{93}$ are the predicates of [[93-df-fep]] and [[93-df-wep]]."}],"outgoing":["d611f4ac8b8895ab","32c4e6b205cc3cd8","77d2ef3450d9750f","6730349967b8ffce","ee84ed8b0fae5bc3","7cc13e0d91069bbd","a8c17e59e6ab2d52"]}